  <main>

    <section class="hero">
      <span class="hero-badge">Payment Help</span>
      <h1>Common Cashfree Payment Issues &amp; Fixes</h1>
      <p>Running into a problem with your payment? Here are the most common issues and how to resolve them quickly.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="content">
      <p class="section-label">Known Issues</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading">What might be going wrong</h2>

      <div class="problem-grid">
        <div class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-tag tag-error">Payment failed</span>
          <h3>Transaction declined at checkout</h3>
          <p>Your card or UPI was declined during payment. This usually happens due to bank-side limits, 3D Secure failure, or an expired card.</p>
          <div class="fix"><strong>Fix</strong>Try a different payment method (UPI, net banking, or another card). Check with your bank if international/online transactions are enabled.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-tag tag-delay">Payment pending</span>
          <h3>Money deducted but subscription not activated</h3>
          <p>Cashfree sometimes marks payments as "pending" while the bank confirms settlement. This can take up to 24 hours in rare cases.</p>
          <div class="fix"><strong>Fix</strong>Wait 2-4 hours and refresh your dashboard. If still unresolved, email us with your transaction ID and we'll manually verify.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-tag tag-refund">Refund</span>
          <h3>Refund not received after cancellation</h3>
          <p>Refunds via Cashfree take 5-7 business days to reflect in your account depending on your bank's processing speed.</p>
          <div class="fix"><strong>Fix</strong>Check your bank statement after 7 working days. If not received, send us the refund reference ID and we'll follow up with Cashfree.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-tag tag-kyc">KYC / Verification</span>
          <h3>Payment blocked due to KYC mismatch</h3>
          <p>Cashfree may block transactions if the billing name doesn't match KYC records, or if your account flags an AML check.</p>
          <div class="fix"><strong>Fix</strong>Ensure the name on your payment method matches your account. Contact us and we can process an alternative payment link.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-tag tag-webhook">Webhook / API</span>
          <h3>Subscription activated then immediately deactivated</h3>
          <p>A race condition between our webhook handler and Cashfree's retry logic can cause a brief deactivation loop.</p>
          <div class="fix"><strong>Fix</strong>This resolves automatically within 10 minutes. If your account still shows inactive after that, contact us with your order ID.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-tag tag-error">UPI</span>
          <h3>UPI payment times out or shows "pending" forever</h3>
          <p>UPI requests expire after 5 minutes if not approved in the payer app. Network issues can also cause the status to get stuck.</p>
          <div class="fix"><strong>Fix</strong>Check your UPI app for a pending request and approve it. If the timer expired, try the payment again - the previous attempt will auto-void.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="steps-section">
      <div class="steps-inner">
        <p class="section-label">What to do</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom:0">Raise a payment issue in 3 steps</h2>
        <div class="steps-grid">
          <div class="step">
            <p class="step-num">Step 1</p>
            <h4>Find your transaction ID</h4>
            <p>Check your email confirmation or Cashfree payment receipt for the order/transaction ID.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <p class="step-num">Step 2</p>
            <h4>Email us</h4>
            <p>Send the transaction ID and a screenshot of the error to <a href="mailto:ayushpatil9977@gmail.com">ayushpatil9977@gmail.com</a>.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <p class="step-num">Step 3</p>
            <h4>We resolve it</h4>
            <p>We'll verify with Cashfree and fix your account status or process a manual refund within 1 business day.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact Now -->
    <section class="contact-now">
      <h2>Still stuck? Contact us now.</h2>
      <p>Our team responds within a few hours on business days. Don't wait - reach out and we'll sort it.</p>
